  <description>
    <p>Kichi is a third-party PikPak desktop client for Linux, built with Rust and Qt 6 for a native desktop experience.</p>
    <p xml:lang="zh_CN">Kichi 是 PikPak 的第三方 Linux 桌面客户端，使用 Rust 和 Qt 6 编写，提供原生桌面体验。</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Browse, search and manage cloud files</li>
      <li>Offline tasks, downloads with resume, uploads and shares</li>
      <li>Embedded libmpv playback, subtitles and resume</li>
      <li xml:lang="zh_CN">云盘浏览与搜索、离线任务、断点下载、上传与分享</li>
      <li xml:lang="zh_CN">内嵌 libmpv 播放、外挂字幕与续播</li>
    </ul>
  </description>

